WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
Your phone pings.

2
00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:06.600
The message starts: «Si tu as le
temps…» A student's dream speech starts:

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.410
«Si j'étais ministre de
l'Éducation…» And a regret starts:

4
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.950
«Si j'avais su…» Three 'ifs':

5
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.530
one likely, one imagined, one too late.

6
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.300
Now each sentence needs its second half.

7
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.060
So which tenses do you choose,

8
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.070
on both sides of «si»,

9
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.240
every time? In this mission,

10
00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.790
you'll build Mission
D1's matrix row by row.

11
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.330
Then you'll build your own in Mission I1,

12
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:35.040
and test past and present
on Mission D2's timeline.

13
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.260
Your mission: crack the
three kinds of «si» sentence,

14
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
and choose the right tenses every time.
